{
  "_comment": [
    "The Midori palette, one definition. Every hex appearing in 4+ tracked",
    "files must appear here -- tests/test_palette_is_defined.py enforces that.",
    "Names are the ones each value ALREADY carries in the file that uses it;",
    "none were invented for this file. Values under a role differ by colour",
    "mode, which is why 17 obsidian tokens carry both a light and a dark hex.",
    "NOTHING IS GENERATED FROM THIS YET. It is a source of truth and a drift",
    "detector; regenerating theme files from it is a separate decision."
  ],
